                                                "sense_id": "c1493af4-28d7-3092-8e75-cc959170dfa8",
                                                "text": "There are flourishes and coloratura passages in this art, heightenings and sharpenings of the line that serve only to give the needy linear system a value of its own in confrontation with nature."
